Credits

The positions of the video chip's access slots in
cores/sg1/core/src/vdp/mod.rs are Roger Sanders's measurements, as Exodus
documents them (https://github.com/RogerSanders/Exodus).

The S-DD1 decompressor in cores/snes1/core/src/cartridge/sdd1/decomp.rs
is written from the public-domain code of Andreas Naive, who worked out
the chip's algorithm.
